ns Artisan Jewelry", "description": "This handmade 14k Gold-filled and Sterling Silver forget-me-not pattern bracelet is absolutely stunning!   Each bracelet is made to order in our jewelry studio located in Sitka, Alaska   A size that is 3/4\" larger than the measurement of the smallest part of your wrist is recommended for the best fit   Sizing guide:  Small - 6 3/4\" inner measurement  S/M - 7\"  Medium - 7 1/4\"  Large - 7 1/2\"  Extr"}, {"listing_id": 1242151360, "title": "925 Sterling Silver Ring Leaf Shaped With Fresh Water Pearl, Textured, Vintage Look Stylish Hypoallergenic, Nickel and Lead-free, Artisan Handcrafted Designer Collection Made in Israel (Size 5-11)", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/1242151360", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 4900, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "JEAN RACHEL JEWELRY", "description": "The Jean Rachel story has been woven into a tapestry of color, texture, and imagery. As a young girl growing up in South Africa, Jean Rachel dreamt of a world filled with texture, color, and vibrancy.  Not content with sitting behind a desk, Jean Rachel harnessed her innate sense of style and sophistication and morphed it into an opportunity.  Seeking to improve their financial conditions, Jean Ra"}, {"listing_id": 283023653, "title": "925 Sterling Silver Wide Ring Flowers and Leaves, Oxidized, Vintage Look Stylish Hypoallergenic, Nickel and Lead-free, Artisan Handcrafted Designer Collection Made in Israel (Size 5-11)", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/283023653", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 4900, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "JEAN RACHEL JEWELRY", "description": "The Jean Rachel story has been woven into a tapestry of color, texture, and imagery. As a young girl growing up in South Africa, Jean Rachel dreamt of a world filled with texture, color, and vibrancy.  Not content with sitting behind a desk, Jean Ra