ce the name. It's the best le"}, {"listing_id": 1791666156, "title": "Nourison 24\" Black Farmhouse Ceramic Pottery Jug Table Lamp", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/1791666156", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 9500, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Nourison", "description": "Add a neutral statement with this ceramic table lamp inspired by antique jug lamps. A medium height allows for versatile placement on a bedside end table, living room side table or dining room buffet."}, {"listing_id": 4094811014, "title": "Polymer Clay Roller Set - Clay Press Machine with Clay Extruder Tool Kit, Clay Earring Cutters Set Stainless Steel Non-Stick Polymer Clay Tools and Supplies for Art Craft Modeling Clay Fondant", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/4094811014", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 3199, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Yoiemivy", "description": "Introducing our cost-effective Clay Extruder Tool Set, perfect for your DIY projects. The clay roller machine features 6 gears for custom clay blends, while the 45-piece shaping tools help mold clay into various shapes. Made of high-quality stainless steel, the roller machine is durable and easy to clean.  The set includes 1 Clay Extruder Tool and 1 Clay Earring Cutters. The Clay Extruder Tool con"}, {"listing_id": 3631415323, "title": "FIYO 6Pcs DIY Painting Glue Clay, Colorful Painting Glue Clay Painting Wax with Glues Clay Storage Box Diamond Art Accessories for Diamond Dots Picture DIY Art Craft (Blue)", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/3631415323", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 439, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "FIYO", "description": "Specification: Condition: Brand New Item Type:  Material: Silica Gel Color: Blue / Red / Purple /Yellow Size: 2x2cm / 0.78x0.72in Application: Diamond Painting, Embroidery Cross Stitch, DIY Design  Package Included: 6 x Embroidery Cross Stitch 1 x Storage Box  Please Note: Children please use it accompanied by parents"}, {"listing_id": 112061802, "title": "My Italian Decor - Italian Murano Glass Christmas Tree, Millefiori Thousand Flowers, Holiday Decoration, Christmas Ornament, Authentic, Hand Painted Italian Glass, Made in Italy", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/112061802", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 4840, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "MY ITALIAN DÉCOR", "description": "Introducing our exquisite Millefiori Murano Glass Christmas Tree Ornament, a stunning addition to your holiday decor. Handcrafted with care, this ornament showcases the intricate beauty of Murano glass. Measuring approximately 3\" x 3\", it is the perfect size to embellish your Christmas tree with elegance and charm. Each ornament is meticulously handmade by skilled artisans in Italy's renowned Mura"}, {"listing_id": 2521917779, "title": "Hide & Drink, Luchador Mask Keychain Handmade from Full Grain Leather", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/2521917779", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 1399, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Hide & Drink", "description": "Hide & Drink's exquisite products are handmade by expert artisans using beautiful Full Grain Leather, giving you a product that will last you a lifetime.\nAll Hide & Drink leather products are handmade from rustic, durable, Full Grain Leather. Our Full Grain Leather comes from the top layer of the hide and has all the natural full grain characteristics of the hide...hence the name. It's the best le"}, {"listing_id": 252635663, "title": "Desantiagodecor Set 4 White Boho Wall Baskets Cotton Embroided, Seagrass Wall Hanging Basket for Home Decor, Best gift idea for Mother's Day", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/252635663", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 5199, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Desantiagodecor", "description": "🍀 𝐀𝐛𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐚𝐠𝐨'𝐬 𝐛𝐨𝐡𝐨 𝐰𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐛𝐚𝐬𝐤𝐞𝐭 - 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐮𝐦 \"\"𝐌𝐚𝐝𝐞 𝐢𝐧 𝐕𝐢𝐞𝐭𝐧𝐚𝐦\"\" 𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐭:\n🍀🍀🍀 𝐅𝐫𝐨𝐦 𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐥 𝐭𝐨 𝐠𝐥𝐨𝐛𝐚𝐥 𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐭:\nInspired by the over the 1000-year tradition of using local materials, our boho wall hanging basket for decoration is an innovative product created by combining traditional techniques with contemporary design. Made from seagrass in Kim Son traditional village in Ninh Binh"}, {"listing_id": 4121429028, "title": "Sajacuzzi Bread Proofing Basket Set, 9 Inch Round + 10 Inch Oval Banneton Bowl for Sourdough + Tools Kit with Dough Whisk, Scraper, Bread Lame and Blades for Bread Making Baking Fermentation", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/4121429028", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 2499, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Sajacuzzi", "description": "The Sajacuzzi Bread Proofing Kit includes one round and one oval banneton bowl, two cloth covers, a dough whisk, scraper, bread lame, and blades. With all the essential tools you need to create delicious proofing breads, this kit is perfect for home bakers and professional artisan bakers alike. Crafted from natural rattan cane material without any dyes or chemicals, our Bannetons have no unpleasan"}, {"listing_id": 3122830467, "title": "Belantina 1/8 Carat Diamond Infinity Pendant Necklace for Women in 14k White and Yellow Gold on 16 to 18 Inch Adjustable Chain (H-I, I1-I2, cttw) Spring Ring", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/3122830467", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 57000, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Belantina", "description": "With roots in Europe, Asia and the Americas, Belantina is truly a multicultural brand. Inspired by centuries of tradition, at our heart we're artisans who tell stories through the pieces we create. We specialize in elegant, fashion forward jewelry drawing inspiration from the world around us and the beauty within us all. We're honored to be a part of so many lives, and thankful for the opportunity"}, {"listing_id": 3036376922, "title": "Belantina 1/8 Carat Diamond Mini Dog Tag Pendant Necklace for Women in 14k White and Yellow Gold on 18 Inch Chain (H-I, I1-I2, cttw) Spring Ring", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/3036376922", "category": "Decorative Vase", "taxonomy_id": 1004, "price": {"amount": 43000, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Belantina", "description": "With roots in Europe, Asia and the Americas, Belantina is truly a multicultural brand. Inspired by centuries of tradition, at our heart we're artisans who tell stories through the pieces we create. We specialize in elegant, fashion forward jewelry drawing inspiration from the world around us and the beauty within us all. We're honored to be a part of so many lives, and thankful for the opportunity"}]}